              <p data-v-45fa8901="">The grim reaper, reimagined as a <i data-v-45fa8901="">unicorn</i>.</p>
              <div class="h2" data-v-45fa8901="">## Philosophy</div>
              <p data-v-45fa8901=""> Muted base, <b data-v-45fa8901="">pastel syntax</b>, nothing that <i data-v-45fa8901="">burns the eyes</i>. </p>
              <div class="h3" data-v-45fa8901="">### Accent order</div>
              <ul data-v-45fa8901="">
                <li data-v-45fa8901="">Blue → Purple → Teal</li>
                <li data-v-45fa8901="">Green = success, Salmon = error</li>
              </ul>
