        <p class="reveal text-fg-muted mb-8 max-w-[460px] text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.7]" data-v-45fa8901=""> One palette, ported to everything I work in: VS Code, terminals, Obsidian, Claude Code &amp; more — each in matching <span class="text-fg" data-v-45fa8901="">dark</span> and <span class="text-fg" data-v-45fa8901="">light</span> variants. </p>
