            <div class="gc-md" data-v-45fa8901="">
              <div class="h1" data-v-45fa8901=""># Grimicorn</div>
              <p data-v-45fa8901="">The grim reaper, reimagined as a <i data-v-45fa8901="">unicorn</i>.</p>
              <div class="h2" data-v-45fa8901="">## Philosophy</div>
              <p data-v-45fa8901=""> Muted base, <b data-v-45fa8901="">pastel syntax</b>, nothing that <i data-v-45fa8901="">burns the eyes</i>. </p>
              <div class="h3" data-v-45fa8901="">### Accent order</div>
              <ul data-v-45fa8901="">
                <li data-v-45fa8901="">Blue → Purple → Teal</li>
                <li data-v-45fa8901="">Green = success, Salmon = error</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="h4" data-v-45fa8901="">#### Heading four</div>
              <div class="h5" data-v-45fa8901="">##### Heading five</div>
              <div class="h6" data-v-45fa8901="">###### Heading six</div>
              <blockquote data-v-45fa8901=""> "Calm by default." — <code data-v-45fa8901="">const calm = true</code></blockquote>
              <p data-v-45fa8901=""><a href="#palette" data-v-45fa8901="">Read the full palette →</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
